stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received: intake accepts request
    received --> validated: validation passes
    received --> rejected: validation fails
    validated --> paid: payment authorised
    validated --> payment_failed: payment declined
    payment_failed --> paid: retry succeeds
    payment_failed --> dead_lettered: retry budget exhausted (3 attempts)
    paid --> fulfilled: fulfilment completes
    rejected --> [*]
    fulfilled --> [*]
    dead_lettered --> [*]
